# Build-context rules for deploy/kind/Dockerfile ONLY. BuildKit reads a file
# named <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile in preference to the
# repository's .dockerignore.
#
# The root .dockerignore excludes scripts/ and fixtures/ because the release
# image ships only the wheel. This demo image needs both -- it seeds real
# artifacts by running the verbs against scripts/demo_server.py with the
# fixtures -- and with the root file alone the documented build fails. As in the
# root file, what this Dockerfile does not COPY stays out of the context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.pypi.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src/
!fixtures/
!scripts/demo_server.py
!deploy/kind/seed.sh
src/veridor.egg-info/
**/__pycache__/
